---
source: crates/ym-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[\"presets\", \"remove\"])"
---
Move a saved preset to the Trash

Usage: ym presets remove [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>  The preset to remove

Options:
  -q, --quiet    Print only errors on stderr
  -v, --verbose  Print what is happening on stderr: stages, timings and notes
  -h, --help     Print help
